=== Not Bundled ===

OCR model weights (CC-BY-SA 4.0), Tesseract and its language data are not
included in any markkit package. `just ocr-models` downloads the pinned models
and writes their license and attribution to target/ocr-models/NOTICE.json.

=== Public Benchmark Tooling ===

scripts/public_benchmarks/vendor includes the Mira Python SDK (Everruns, MIT),
the AgentDocBench scorer (SylphxAI, MIT), and the WCXB scorer (Murrough Foley,
CC-BY-4.0), each with its license. Input documents retain the individual
licenses and attribution in scripts/public_benchmarks/CORPUS-NOTICE and
agentdocbench-corpus.json. The downloaded corpora are not included in packages.
